Triangle of number of linear [ n,k ] ternary codes (n >= 1, k >= 1) without 0 columns.

The 36 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A034363

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 4, 3, 1,
    1, 5, 8, 4, 1, 1, 8, 19, 15, 5,
    1, 1, 10, 39, 50, 24, 6, 1, 1, 14,
